{
 "Iron, sellswords, loyalty. In that order - and loyalty costs extra.": "钢铁、佣兵、忠诚。就是这个顺序——忠诚另外收费。",
 "My men train in the snow. Yours train in the rain. Mine win.": "我的兵在雪里操练。你的兵在雨里操练。赢的是我的兵。",
 "Ravenholt has never been taken. It has been rented.": "Ravenholt 从未被攻陷过。只是被租出去过。",
 "Business in the Upper Ward? Then walk straight and do not touch the catapult.": "去上城区办事？那就直着走，别碰投石机。",
 "The gate shuts at dusk. Mostly.": "城门黄昏时关闭。大多数时候是。",
 "The Margrave is in. He is always in.": "藩侯在府上。他从来都在府上。",
 "The Hall hires out swords by the season.": "大厅按季出租刀剑。",
 "Twenty good blades for five million - that is the Meridian price. Robbery. Worth it.": "二十把好刀，五百万——这就是 Meridian 的价钱。简直是抢劫。但值。",
 "You want an army? Port Meridian. The Free Company sells them by the score.": "想要一支军队？去 Port Meridian。自由佣兵团二十人一批地卖。",
 "A shield is a wall you carry.": "盾牌就是你随身带着的城墙。",
 "Again! And this time hit the dummy, not the air.": "再来！这回打假人，别打空气。",
 "Snow? Snow is just softer ground to fall on.": "雪？雪不过是摔上去更软的地面。",
 "The fortress in the northern passes: iron, sellswords and snow.": "北方山口的要塞：钢铁、佣兵与白雪。",
 "Kneel if you like. Most do. It does not buy anything.": "想跪就跪吧。大多数人都跪。但这换不来任何东西。",
 "My council sits in the east wing. They argue. I decide.": "我的议会在东翼开会。他们争论。我拍板。",
 "Silverfjord does not bow. It lends.": "Silverfjord 从不低头。它放贷。",
 "The fjord is deeper than any debt, and so is my patience - almost.": "峡湾比任何债务都深，我的耐心也是——差不多吧。",
 "Ravenholt sells swords. We do not need to buy them.": "Ravenholt 卖刀剑。我们用不着买。",
 "The walls hold. The walls always hold.": "城墙守得住。城墙永远守得住。",
 "Two hundred guards, and every one of them polished.": "两百名卫兵，个个擦得锃亮。",
 "If the mountain speaks, we listen.": "大山若开口，我们便聆听。",
 "Mistress of Mines Ragnhild": "矿务大臣 Ragnhild",
 "Silver is patient. Miners are not.": "白银有耐心。矿工可没有。",
 "The Deep Vein gave three wagons today.": "深脉今天出了三车矿。",
 "Emberfall wants our silver cheap. Emberfall will wait.": "Emberfall 想压低我们的银价。那 Emberfall 就等着吧。",
 "Every coin in the realm remembers this room.": "王国里的每一枚钱币，都记得这个房间。",
 "Master of Silver Eirik": "白银大臣 Eirik",
 "The Mint needs more coal, not more opinions.": "铸币厂需要的是更多的煤，不是更多的意见。",
 "A council without a prayer is a market.": "不做祷告的议会，就是个集市。",
 "The Deep Water is listening.": "深水在聆听。",
 "The black ship in our harbour? Leave it be.": "我们港口里那艘黑船？别管它。",
 "The Silver Swan can outrun anything in the north.": "北方没有什么船跑得过银天鹅号。",
 "Mind the damp. It is older than the palace.": "当心潮气。它比王宫还老。",
 "Nine cells, nine regrets.": "九间牢房，九桩悔恨。",
 "Nobody has ever left early. Nobody.": "从来没人提前出去过。一个也没有。",
 "I did not run. I walked. Quickly.": "我没逃。我是走的。走得快了点。",
 "Is it morning? It is always morning in here.": "现在是早上吗？这里头永远是早上。",
 "It was the King’s deer. It was also very slow.": "那是国王的鹿。可它也跑得太慢了。",
 "The coin was real. The King on it was not.": "钱币是真的。上面的国王不是。",
 "The silver fell into my boat. On its own.": "银子是掉进我船里的。自己掉进来的。",
 "King Sigvald’s throne hall, the council chamber and the cells below.": "Sigvald 国王的王座大厅、议事厅，以及地下的牢房。",
 "Down to the jail": "下到监狱",
 "Up to the throne hall": "上到王座大厅",
