 "If you want out, find the black ship in the harbour.": "想出去的话，就去港口找那艘黑船。",
 "Nobody leaves by land - the passes are the King’s.": "谁也不能走陆路离开——山口归国王所有。",
 "The gates are shut. Silverfjord trades by sea.": "城门关着。Silverfjord 只走海路做买卖。",
 "Mind the carpet. It cost more than your ship.": "当心地毯。它比你的船还贵。",
 "The King receives in the throne hall. Go in.": "国王在王座大厅接见访客。进去吧。",
 "Silver comes down this road every morning. Under guard.": "每天早上，白银都从这条路运下来。有卫兵押送。",
 "The miners? Up in the mountain. They come down on feast days.": "矿工？在山上。节庆日才下山。",
 "The mines are the King’s. Nobody passes.": "矿山归国王所有。任何人不得通行。",
 "Feel it. No, gently.": "摸摸看。不，轻点。",
 "For a lady of your standing, half price. Almost.": "像你这样有身份的女士，半价。差不多半价。",
 "Silk from the south, blue from the north.": "南方的丝绸，北方的靛蓝。",
 "Mined here, worked here, sold here.": "这里开采，这里打造，这里出售。",
 "No haggling. This is Silverfjord.": "不讲价。这里是 Silverfjord。",
 "That cup? Fjord silver. It rings.": "那只杯子？峡湾银。一敲就响。",
 "Mind the edge - the fjord has no bottom.": "当心边上——峡湾是没有底的。",
 "The black ship? The King lets it moor. Nobody knows why.": "那艘黑船？国王准许它停泊。没人知道为什么。",
 "The Silver Swan is the fastest ship in the north.": "银天鹅号是北方最快的船。",
 "Light a candle for the miners.": "为矿工们点一支蜡烛吧。",
 "Silverfjord was built on a promise to the fjord.": "Silverfjord 建立在对峡湾许下的一个承诺之上。",
 "The Deep Water gives, and the Deep Water keeps.": "深水有所赐，亦有所留。",
 "Silver is steady. Everything else is weather.": "白银恒稳。其余一切，不过是风云变幻。",
 "The Exchange opens at the first bell.": "交易所头一声钟响就开门。",
 "The Mint strikes a thousand coins before breakfast.": "铸币厂早饭前就能铸出一千枚钱币。",
 "Boxes are sold out until midwinter.": "包厢已售罄，一直到隆冬。",
 "Please - no armour in the stalls.": "劳驾——正厅座位不许穿盔甲。",
 "Tonight: The Drowned King, in five acts.": "今晚上演：《溺亡之王》，共五幕。",
 "The jewel of the north, walled in white granite: silver, marble and King Sigvald’s palace.": "北方的明珠，环绕着白色花岗岩城墙：白银、大理石，以及 Sigvald 国王的王宫。",
