 "A sure-footed spotted hunter with a swift, rolling stride.": "步伐稳健的斑点猎手，奔跑起来迅捷而起伏有致。",
 "Blue spirit-fire shimmers beneath its ancient silver armour.": "古老的银甲之下，闪烁着蓝色的灵火。",
 "Midnight scales, sapphire wings and a crown of gold horns. It was an egg once; now the sky is its road.": "午夜般的鳞片，蓝宝石般的双翼，金角如冠。它曾是一枚蛋；如今，天空就是它的道路。",
