 "Scatter seeds for damage and a small protective shell.": "撒出种子造成伤害，并获得一层薄薄的护壳。",
 "A nimble rabbit sheltered by soft bramble leaves.": "一只身手敏捷的兔子，藏身于柔软的荆棘叶下。",
 "Nibble healing berries, then give a quick kick.": "啃几颗疗伤浆果，再飞快地踢上一脚。",
 "A patient little toad with a stony crown.": "一只耐心十足的小蟾蜍，头顶石质的冠。",
 "Build a sturdy shield and strengthen the next two attacks.": "筑起坚固的护盾，并强化接下来的两次攻击。",
 "A fearless songbird that nests in wild thistles.": "一只无畏的鸣禽，在野蓟丛中筑巢。",
 "Dive for heavy damage with a small recoil.": "俯冲造成重创，自身承受少量反冲。",
 "An amber-shelled beetle carrying a droplet of sap.": "一只琥珀色甲壳的甲虫，背着一滴树液。",
 "Strike and leave sap that stings for two turns.": "攻击并留下树液，刺痛两回合。",
 "A russet fox with moss-soft ears and clever eyes.": "一只赤褐色的狐狸，耳朵像苔藓一样柔软，眼神机灵。",
 "Lash out behind a mossy decoy.": "躲在苔藓诱饵后面出击。",
 "A playful river otter wearing a crown of reeds.": "一只顽皮的河獭，头戴芦苇编成的冠。",
 "Wash away poison, heal, and splash the opponent.": "冲走毒素，恢复生命，再朝对手泼一身水。",
 "A velvety moth dusted with the colors of sunset.": "一只天鹅绒般的飞蛾，身上洒满落日的色彩。",
